{#
The bar that appears when the session ends underneath a page that is still open.

Rendered on every page and hidden, rather than built in JavaScript, because
every string in it needs translating and translation is a server-side concern
here. The controller only unhides it and chooses which of the two sentences to
show.

Two sentences, and the difference is the whole point of the feature. With
nothing being written, ending up on the login page is what the user wants and
the bar just says so. With a half-written mail on screen, a redirect would throw
away everything since the last autosave — so the offer is to sign in in a new
tab and come back to a page that still has the text in it.
#}
<div id="session-expired"
     data-controller="core--session-guard"
     data-core--session-guard-login-url-value="{{ path('app_login') }}"
     class="hidden fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-[300] px-4 py-3
            bg-surface border-b-2 border-danger shadow-float"
     role="alert"
     aria-live="assertive">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-3xl items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation shrink-0 text-danger" aria-hidden="true"></i>

        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <p class="font-medium text-ink">{{ 'session.expired.heading'|trans }}</p>
            <p class="text-ink-soft"
               data-core--session-guard-target="body"
               data-body="{{ 'session.expired.body'|trans }}"
               data-body-writing="{{ 'session.expired.body_writing'|trans }}"></p>
        </div>

        <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}"
           data-turbo="false"
           data-core--session-guard-target="signIn"
           data-label="{{ 'session.expired.sign_in'|trans }}"
           data-label-new-tab="{{ 'session.expired.sign_in_new_tab'|trans }}"
           class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent px-4 py-2 font-medium text-on-accent"></a>

        <button type="button"
                data-action="click->core--session-guard#reload"
                class="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-line px-4 py-2 font-medium text-ink-soft hover:bg-hover">
            {{ 'session.expired.reload'|trans }}
        </button>
    </div>
</div>
